SUMMARY:Challenging Ride (A) - LV New Holland Coffee Company (30R)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nAnticipated average pace:
  **18-20 mph**\n\nhttps://ridewithgps.com/routes/33688119\n\n\\*\\*\\*\\* 
 Plan on stopping at the New Holland Coffee Company for a coffee break and 
 other refreshments (30-40 minute stop)\n\n**This is a Challenging (A) leve
 l ride and intended to be a NO DROP RIDE.** The ride leader will ride at t
 he advertised average speed and will do his/her best to keep the group tog
 ether with regroupings and a sweeper may also be appointed at the start. *
 *Please do not join this ride if you are not willing to stick with the gro
 up.** If maintaining an 18-20mph average is beyond your current ability le
 vel\, please consider joining an "Advanced" ride first.\n\nHelmets are man
 datory. No earbuds. Please bring water and a basic repair kit (spare tube\
 , tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate passing around a pen a
 nd paper waiver\, we require an LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below 
 to join this ride.\n\nBeing on Meetup does not mean you are a club member.
  [Join here](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&clu
 b_id=257148).\n\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's [Code 
 of Conduct](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&c
 lub_id=257148&module_id=323984)\,\n\n[Rules of the Road](https://lancbikec
 lub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=32515
 9)\, and [Ride Waiver](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/docs.ashx?id=454318)
