SUMMARY:Intermediate Ride (C) - Nissley Nicely 34 (R)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n**Be Safe\, Have Fun\, an
 d Ride Together**\n\nRide leader: Lynn Pfeil\nSweep: Volunteer to Sweep!\n
 Anticipated Average Pace: (14-16 mph)\nRoute: https://ridewithgps.com/rout
 es/52102235\n(not an official club ride)\nThis is an Intermediate C Class 
 ride. The ride leader will ride at the advertised average speed. This is i
 ntended to be a group ride with a no-drop rule as the main goal. The ride 
 leader will do his/her best to keep the group together with occasional reg
 roupings and/or splitting into multiple groups to align to pace capabiliti
 es.\n\nPlease do not join this ride if you are not willing to ride with th
 e group. If you exceed the posted pace\, you will be riding by yourself an
 d encouraged to join a faster group. If maintaining a 14-16 mph average is
  beyond your current ability level\, please consider joining a slower ride
  first.\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds. Please bring water and a bas
 ic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo elimin
 ate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we require LBC Club membership
  and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride. Being on Meetup does not mean yo
 u are a club member. Join here [Member Signup](https://www.lancasterbikecl
 ub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\n\nYour RSVP is your agreem
 ent to abide by the club's Code of Conduct: [Code of Conduct](https://www.
 lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323
 984)\n\nGuidance if an incident occurs: [Incident Actions](https://lancast
 erbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=326137)
