SUMMARY:LBC Bike to 30K Program: Ride #7 Bird in Hand Short (11 Miles)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nGrab your helmets\, bikes
  and sneakers and join Lancaster Bike Club for beginner and transitional r
 ides. Local members of the Lancaster Bike Club will be hosting a Bike to 3
 0K program!\n\\*\\*\\*\nAbout the Program.........\nThis program is design
 ed to take cyclists from a five mile ride while gradually increasing their
  fitness level and mileage up to eighteen miles during a seven week time p
 eriod. Lancaster Bike Club hopes to expose old\, new\, returning and curre
 nt cyclists to the joy of cycling. The Bike to 30K program is open to all 
 members of our community.\n\\*\\*\\*\nEver wonder why we cycle? Because it
 ’s fun! There’s nothing like riding downhill and saying weeeeeee all t
 he way down. But if you’re new to cycling\, we get it. We understand tha
 t 18 miles might be a little too steep to start. That’s why we are offer
 ing Bike to 30K!!!!\nEach week\, you will gradually increase your mileage.
  This program is designed to help you over time graduate to be a “Fun”
  rider while getting acclimated to the club and its members.\nLBC wants to
  support our new members and community in meeting their cycling goals. As 
 part of our initiative to encourage new members/cyclists to get out and cy
 cle\, we are offering the Bike to 30k cycling program. Spend just 7 weeks 
 gradually becoming a Fun rider!!!!\nLBC Bike to 30K program is designed to
  prepare you to ride with the Fun riders and ultimately to increase your l
 evel of physical activity. The Bike to 30k program is voluntary.\n\\*\\*\\
 *\nTo eliminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we require an LBC 
 Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride. Your RSVP also al
 lows us to contact you after the ride if necessary. Please note ONLY club 
 members who RSVP are covered by the club excess accident insurance policy.
  If you are a club member and do not RSVP\, you are not covered by the clu
 b excess accident insurance policy. Meetup is our RSVP tool and being on M
 eetup does not mean you are a club member. To join our wonderful club\, pl
 ease [Join here](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60
 &club_id=257148).\nPlease plan to arrive 10-15 minutes before the start ti
 me of the ride & make sure your bike is in working condition. Helmets are 
 mandatory\; please also plan to bring 1-2 water bottles\, and basic repair
  kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator). For everyone’s safe
 ty\, ear buds and music are not allowed.\n\\*\\*\\*\nRSVP is required and 
 Your RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's [Code of Conduct](https
 ://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&mod
 ule_id=323984)\, the [Rules of the Road](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.
 com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=325159) and Our [Ride
  Waiver](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/docs.ashx?id=454318).\n\\*\\*\\*\nW
 e've gone social! Join us on our Facebook Page: https://www.facebook.com/B
 230K\n• What to bring\nWater bottle\, bike\, helmet and sneakers\nCue Sh
 eet to the Ride: [Ride #7 Bird In Hand Short](https://routes.lancasterbike
 club.net/cue/bi-bird-in-hand-short-11f/)\n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\
 *\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\
 \*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*
 \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n***The Bike to 30K is brought to you by
  Lancaster Bicycle Club and Lancaster Trek Bikes.***
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3132653
